@prefix rl: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/repository-lifecycle#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

rl:RepositoryState a rdfs:Class .
rl:Build a rdfs:Class .
rl:Qualification a rdfs:Class .
rl:Release a rdfs:Class .
rl:ProviderProfile a rdfs:Class .
rl:input a rdf:Property .
rl:output a rdf:Property .
rl:qualifiedBy a rdf:Property .
rl:releasedAs a rdf:Property .
